ScoreWarrior is a simple but not simple app that helps young partners achieve self-discipline.

characteristic:

-Accumulate self-discipline confidence step by step with the unique way of scoring yourself;
-You can set tasks with different time limits, different difficulties and different scores every day;
-The task regeneration mechanism eliminates the need to create repetitive redundant tasks;
-Good list organization, putting related tasks together, making management easier;
-There are countless virtual partners in the App to accompany you in competitions, interactions, mutual encouragement and common progress;
-Countless medals are waiting to be picked by you;
-Various reminder mechanisms ensure that you will not forget to score every day;
-Clock in every day, which makes you love it;
-The daily automatic summary allows the partners to easily increase their scores;
-Detailed task execution records, recording your progress every day;
-The rich grading system makes your daily progress clear;
-The vivid interactive wizard enables you to master the basic skills of using apps faster and better;
-Easy to use timer and counter functions enable you to control tasks more accurately;
-There are more payment levels to expand stronger functions for you;
